        <qualifiedname>nexus::Daemon::Channel::connectionLost</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Called on the message thread when the connection is lost. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Removes this connection from the <ref refid="classnexus_1_1_daemon" kindref="compound">Daemon</ref> broadcast list and all per-session subscriber lists. <computeroutput>daemon.removeConnection</computeroutput> destroys this object last.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>NEXUS PROCESS MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
