      <memberdef kind="function" id="classnexus_1_1_daemon_1_1_channel_1a4695c3d5b7d45f3aed446d22ad939df3" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>void</type>
        <definition>void nexus::Daemon::Channel::messageReceived</definition>
        <argsstring>(const juce::MemoryBlock &amp;message) override</argsstring>
        <name>messageReceived</name>
        <qualifiedname>nexus::Daemon::Channel::messageReceived</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const juce::MemoryBlock &amp;</type>
          <declname>message</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Dispatches an incoming message from the client. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Decodes <computeroutput><ref refid="classMessage" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">Message</ref></computeroutput> kind from the first 2 bytes of <computeroutput>message</computeroutput>, then handles each PDU kind. All work runs on the message thread because <computeroutput>callbacksOnMessageThread</computeroutput> is <computeroutput>true</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>PDU kinds handled:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>hello</computeroutput> → sends <computeroutput>helloResponse</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>ping</computeroutput> → sends <computeroutput>pong</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>createSession</computeroutput> → decodes cwd/uuid/cols/rows; creates if new via nexus.create, subscribes+sends history, then broadcastSessions</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>input</computeroutput> → decodes uuid + bytes, calls nexus.get(uuid).sendInput</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>resizeSession</computeroutput> → decodes uuid + cols + rows, resizes Processor then PTY</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classnexus_1_1_daemon_1aea246ba3a19ec3caa1acff4dc370f075" kindref="member">detachSession</ref></computeroutput> → unregisters subscription via daemon.detachSession</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>killSession</computeroutput> → calls nexus.remove(uuid)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>killDaemon</computeroutput> → calls daemon.killAll() to shut down the daemon process</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>message</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Raw <ref refid="classMemoryBlock" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/doxygen/doc/juce.tag">MemoryBlock</ref> received from the JUCE IPC layer. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>NEXUS PROCESS MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
